---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';import WorkCard from '../../components/WorkCard.astro';import Filter from '../../components/Filter.astro';import {work} from '../../data/site';
---
<Layout title="OpenCV Contributions"><div id="top"></div><section class="page-intro container"><span class="eyebrow">OPEN SOURCE / OPENCV</span><h1>Good engineering.<br/><span class="blue-text">In plain sight.</span></h1><p>Selected contributions to OpenCV’s inference engine and core infrastructure. The problems, the design decisions, and the public review behind the code.</p></section><section class="page-content container"><Filter categories={[...new Set(work.flatMap(item => item.tags))]}/><div class="work-grid">{work.map((item,index)=><WorkCard item={item} index={index}/>)}</div><p class="note">These are individual contributions within a collaborative project. Each case study credits the source record; OpenCV is not an endorsement of this website.</p><div class="project-detail"><h2>Follow the source.</h2><p>For the wider contribution history, code reviews, and work in progress, see the public OpenCV record.</p><div class="source-actions"><a class="button outline" href="https://github.com/opencv/opencv/pulls?q=is%3Apr+author%3Aabhishek-gola">Authored pull requests ↗</a><a class="button outline" href="https://github.com/opencv/opencv/wiki/GSoC_2026">GSoC mentorship ↗</a></div></div></section></Layout>
